" 、横截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S = 10\\mathrm{cm}^2"},{"type":"text","value":" 的活塞密封一定质量的理想气体。当环境温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 27^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，气体高度维持 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 20cm"},{"type":"text","value":" 不变，随着环境温度逐渐升高至 "},{"type":"math","value":"127^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，缸内气体压强变为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.12\\times 10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知整个过程中缸内气体的内能增加了 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = 20\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。取大气压 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_0 = 1.0\\times 10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，不计活塞与气缸间的阻力，求：\n(1) 环境温度逐渐升高, 活塞运动至卡口前的过程中, 气体分子的平均动能 （填空） (选填“增加”、“减少”或“不变”), 圆筒内壁单位面积受到的压力 （填空） (选填“增大”、“减小”或“不变”);\n（2）活塞恰好到达容器卡口处时的环境温度；\n（3）缸内气体在整个过程中从外界吸收的热量Q。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4127ccc7845fcd1a99bac443baf6504aa6f23de44426d175330e8cbca99af899.png","width":224,"height":314,"width_mm":26.211,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-gaosan-fanxiaokao-2508-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 g 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (8 分)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1）增加、不变 （2分）"},{"type":"text","value":"(2) 初始状态"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1}S=P_{0}S+mg"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"P_1=1.05\\times10^{5}\\,\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"text","value":"到达卡扣前是等压变化，"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{2}=P_{1}=1.05\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"到达卡扣处后是等容变化，由查理定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{P_2}{T_2}=\\frac{P_3}{T_3}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=375K"},{"type":"text","value":"（或"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=102^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":"）（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）从初始状态到卡扣处的过程中，是等压变化"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Sh}{T_1} = \\frac{S(h + \\Delta h)}{T_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta h = 5\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）等压变化，外界对气体做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=-P_1S\\Delta h=-5.25\\,\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"根据热力学第一定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）得："},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 25.25J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-gaosan-fanxiaokao-2508-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-gaosan-fanxiaokao-2508","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-gaosan-fanxiaokao-2508-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"375ac8e9b16197513647c0be712a3e2c64d3777f13a322acc3ccf65fba8b09fb","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）如图所示为某游戏装置侧面图。半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 1.0\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 圆弧轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 固定，质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 0.2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"r = 0.06\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的半圆弧轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 锁定在水平面 "},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":" 上，一长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 0.8\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、质量也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 0.2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的平板小车停在 "},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":" 轨道的最左端紧靠 "},{"type":"math","value":"BM"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小车上表面与 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 点等高，将一可视为质点、质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.8kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑块从距 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点高度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h"},{"type":"text","value":" 处静止释放，滑上小车后带动小车向右运动，小车与轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 碰撞（碰撞时间极短）后即被粘在 "},{"type